{"game": "space-marine-2011", "language": "english", "appid": 55150, "month": "2016-05", "window": 3, "start_date": 1463356800, "end_date": 1464047999, "month_true_total": 50, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-10-09 17:52:14 UTC", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "23159592", "author": {"steamid": "76561197970692296", "personaname": "Raiken", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561197970692296/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 22, "playtime_forever": 666, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 666, "last_played": 1447650994, "avatar": "b93f04b9194fba8980a2dc74947d47d0087ba113"}, "language": "english", "review": "I really enjoyed this game while it lasted. You play as space marine fighting off the orcs and a unknown enemy. The multiplayer is actually fun if your able to find a game. As you gain exerpeince you are able to customize your character's suit, weapons, and colors.", "timestamp_created": 1464027490, "timestamp_updated": 1464027490, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.480769246816635132", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1315281600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "23159299", "author": {"steamid": "76561198297386083", "personaname": "Grim_Reaper", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198297386083/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 1, "playtime_forever": 82, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 82, "last_played": 1462266203, "avatar": "2cc8835c8b3cbfd9419d045c231ecc7bfb5a2eee"}, "language": "english", "review": "Awsome", "timestamp_created": 1464026393, "timestamp_updated": 1464026393, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 1, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1315281600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "23153863", "author": {"steamid": "76561198080117681", "personaname": "ArtyomGR", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/artyomGR/", "num_games_owned": 539, "num_reviews": 123, "playtime_forever": 481, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 481, "last_played": 1464002129, "avatar": "883f2697f5b2dc4affda2d47eedc1cbec8cfb657"}, "language": "english", "review": "I didn't had a lot of hope for this game, I was doubting it a lot. But after playing some time, I realised how amazing it is! It seems easy, and simple, but I actually had a lot of fun kicking ass with a Spacemarine. The weapons are devastating in their own, brutal way. The campaign is a bit shorter then I expected, but it has a good plot and gameplay. I also like the difficulty setting then other shooters these days, both 3rd and 1st. You have to be careful and look around carefully so you don't get your ass beaten. This was the same for the multiplayer. At first I just charged in blindly, which resulted into me dying a lot. Speaking of the multiplayer, I haven't fully done it yet, but I can already tell it seems to be a fun experience. I have great hopes for Spacemarine and i will hope for a sequel.", "timestamp_created": 1464002202, "timestamp_updated": 1464002202, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 7, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.601839601993560791", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": true, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1315281600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "23147195", "author": {"steamid": "76561198094633448", "personaname": "Ghostmachine97", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198094633448/", "num_games_own